vengeance sword holy sacred artifact~
The hilt is white marble worked so fine it looks poured rather than carved,
and the pommel is a single ruby the size of a fist. Three holy symbols are
set into the crossguard, and no two of them agree about anything except this
sword. It took one smith a lifetime and two more to finish it.
~
