E
wyrmfang spear dragons horn artifact~
The shaft is one continuous piece of horn taken from something gargantuan
and black. Nearly eight feet from butt to point, it takes two hands to bring
around. The arcane symbols cut along its length are not in any hand a scholar
has been able to place. It is a hunting weapon. It was made by someone who
had already decided what they were hunting.
~
